            <div xml:id="1906_08_26_SD_PS_006">
                <p>
                    <occupation>Nätta kokerskeplatser</occupation> inom <placeName type="employment" ref="#malmö">Malmö</placeName> sökas den <date notAfter="1906-10-28" type="begin">28 Okt.</date> af <ref type="reference">2:ne välrek</ref>, <person sex="female" role="employee">kokerskor</person>, som <trait type="skill">lärt matlagning</trait> och derefter <trait type="experience">innehaft platser i finare privathus</trait>. <person sex="unspecified" role="mediator">Rydows Agentur</person>, <placeName type="application" ref="#malmö">Malmö</placeName>. Tel. <num type="phone">1477</num>. (<idno type="advertisement">STM. 134530</idno>)</p>
